# Check Errors After Every Edit

After **every** code change (StrReplace, Write, etc.), immediately run `ReadLints` on the edited file **before** telling the user to build or test.

- If there are errors, fix them in the same turn.
- Never say "build and check" until lints pass.
- If the user reports "nothing updated" or "it didn't change", the first thing to check is linter/build errors — not logic.
